idth="399" height="220" loading="lazy" data-original-width="399" data-original-height="220" itemprop="http://schema.org/image" title="Screen Shot 2015-12-15 at 12.02.30 am" alt="Screen Shot 2015-12-15 at 12.02.30 am" style="width: 399px; height: 220px;" /> </a> </div> </div> <!-- close group --> </div> <!-- close row --> </div>
<p>I<em>mages: On left, White Helmets video shown on ABC TV news report; a typical WH’s video, showing a man with the WH’s logo on display and a young child in his arms. It is unusual to see women in their videos.</em></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
